# Console System - xoay vong nhat ky, CHI GIU 7 NGAY
#
# Yeu cau cua tac gia (27/09/2026): toan bo nhat ky tren may chi giu 7 ngay
# (truoc day 60 ngay). "daily + rotate 7" = moi ngay 1 ban, giu 7 ban roi
# xoa. "maxsize" van giu de 1 file phinh bat thuong (loi lap lai lien tuc)
# khong lam day the nho truoc khi toi moc ngay.
#
# console-pi-errors.log: errlog.py chi ghi them (append), viec xoay vong
# GIAO HET cho logrotate o day - 1 co che duy nhat, tranh xung dot.
#
# (c) 2026 zTieuYeuz - Console System
/var/log/console-pi-*.log
{
    daily
    rotate 7
    maxsize 5M
    compress
    delaycompress
    missingok
    notifempty
    copytruncate
}
